    "abstract": "Parts figure for the trim air pressure regulating valve installation, covering the valve, the manifold, the filter, the ducting and the transmitter at all four zone positions.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the trim air pressure regulating valve and the manifold items around it at all four zone positions.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows one valve position; the four positions are identical apart from duct length. The regulator is not a separable item: it is supplied as part of the valve body at item 10 and is not procurable on its own. Duct item 40 is cut to the length of the position it serves and the four lengths are listed in the table on the sheet."
    },
